        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Representative weakness: malicious macro document leading to code execution (initial vector in E6). AV:N delivered by e-mail; AC:L; AT:N; PR:N; UI:P user opens the document; VC/VI/VA:H on the workstation; SC/SI/SA:H because EHR and clinic systems are subsequently affected. CVSS describes the entry weakness only, not the enterprise impact."
      },
      "crgo:CRGO_0000257": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H",
